map.某小区总用地 50000 m²，其中绿地 8000 m²、树冠投影 2000 m:
A community with total site area 50000 m², of which 8000 m² is green space, 2000 m² is tree canopy projection, and 2000 residents:
Green space ratio = 8000 / 50000 × 100% = 16%;
Green coverage ratio = (8000 + 2000) / 50000 × 100% = 20%;
Per-capita green space = 8000 / 2000 = 4 m² per person.
In this example the 16% green space ratio does not meet the ≥30% requirement for new residential areas, so centralized green space must be added or the site remediated.
